# PROJECT CHARTER

## 1. Project Title
Retail Business Intelligence & Growth Analytics

## 2. Business Background
The organization is a Noida-based apparel retailer operating 25 physical stores along with a growing online sales channel. The company has accumulated several years of business data through its legacy Point of Sale (POS) system, marketplace seller portal, and Customer Relationship Management (CRM) system.

However, these systems are not properly integrated, and most business decisions are still made using spreadsheets and manual analysis.

## 3. Problem Statement
The retailer faces challenges in analyzing sales performance, understanding customer purchasing behaviour, managing inventory efficiently, and making accurate business forecasts due to fragmented data systems and limited analytical capabilities.

## 4. Project Objectives
- Analyze historical sales and business performance.
- Identify high-performing and low-performing products and stores.
- Understand customer purchasing behaviour.
- Identify opportunities to improve customer retention.
- Analyze inventory efficiency and demand patterns.
- Develop predictive models for sales or demand forecasting.
- Design interactive business intelligence dashboards.
- Recommend a structured 18-month analytics transformation roadmap.

## 5. Project Scope
The project will cover data acquisition, preprocessing, exploratory data analysis, customer segmentation, predictive analytics, SQL-based reporting, Power BI dashboards, business strategy, and ROI estimation.

## 6. Key Stakeholders
- Business Owner / CEO
- Retail Operations Manager
- Marketing Manager
- Finance Manager
- IT / Technology Manager
- Data Analytics Team

## 7. Expected Outcomes
- Improved visibility into business performance.
- Better understanding of customer behaviour.
- Identification of inventory optimization opportunities.
- Data-driven sales and marketing recommendations.
- Predictive insights for business planning.
- A phased analytics implementation roadmap.

## 8. Technology Stack
Python, Pandas, NumPy, Matplotlib, Seaborn, Scikit-learn, SQL, MySQL, Power BI, Excel, and GitHub.

## 9. Project Duration
45 Days for project development and implementation.

## 10. Final Deliverables
Maturity Assessment Report, Data Analysis Reports, Customer Segmentation Analysis, Predictive Analytics Model, SQL Data Mart, Power BI Dashboard, Prioritization Matrix, Dependency Map, 18-Month Roadmap, ROI Model, and Leadership Presentation.
